  m_Name: Cerberus_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  objectName: CERBERUS
  description: "<color=orange>CLASS: LESSER DEMON\n\nDATA:</color>\nAlthough they
    do not resemble the mythological three-headed dog, this name was chosen due to
    their nature as protectors of Hell. However, it's not yet known why some stay
    dormant despite provocation. \n\nDespite the fact that keeping an energy orb
    stable takes a considerable amount of focus and effort, they seem to always keep
    one in hand, most likely as a display of their power to scare off intruders.\n\n<color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>\n-
    Due to remaining entirely stationary until awoken, they move quite slowly, but
    the stone-like exterior provides good protection against even powerful attacks.\n\n-
    They're quite adept at throwing, but their slow movement makes it easy to break
    line of sight for extended periods of time.\n\n- Their large size makes them
    an ample target for both headshots and imprecise attacks."
  gameObject: {fileID: 1709254077376921, guid: 5ebcdc90eaef5db45acefd994b10abb9, type: 3}
